// Reusable App Insights query: per-endpoint request count and latency percentiles.
// Resource: appi-3kjx6gefa6seo (rg-thinkschool-dev-shared), workspace log-3kjx6gefa6seo.
//
// Intended to be saved as a Log Analytics function (Logs tab -> Save -> Function) named
// QuotesApiEndpointLatency. Saving it via the CLI/ARM API in this workspace requires a
// storage account linked to the Query data source type, which this environment doesn't
// have provisioned - so it's saved here as a checked-in, reusable query instead.
requests
| where timestamp > ago(30m)
| summarize count(), p50=percentile(duration, 50), p99=percentile(duration, 99) by name
| order by p99 desc
